msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-silentwings.rst:12
#: 09f5ed48caa84097aa79f6d8a1465e85
msgid "Silent Wings is a simulator that focuses specifically on sailplanes. In spite of being somewhat dated by now, as of April 2019 it still provides some of the most accurate simulations of sailplane flight and details of atmospheric phenomena that matter for it, such as thermal lifecycles, distribution of thermal and ridge lift over terrain, their dependence on weather, etc. This makes it a great tool for testing various aspects of autonomous soaring."
msgstr ""

